- [ ] Ctrl+E quick exports with defaults
- [ ] Export progress visible in modal
- [ ] Success/error feedback displayed
- [ ] CLI export-html command works
- [ ] --open flag opens browser
- [ ] Error codes correct for each failure type
- [ ] Both TUI and CLI use same export pipeline

